; Concrete solution data for FLT/Three.lean:699-738.
; Every unit, nondivisibility, nonzero, coprime, divisor and cubic
; equation certificate is retained. Ordered solutions add the actual
; exact lambda order; smaller solutions carry all values and a strict
; order comparison. These definitions assert no solution exists.
